007  where he's best known for one of the  most memorable blocks in football  history a block which led to the saints  first  point in 21 months after the superdome  was closed due to hurricane katrina  in 2011 gleason revealed he was battling  als  and became an advocate for als awareness  eventually being awarded the  congressional gold medal for his  contributions so it's kind of fitting  the heroic character in this story wears  the jersey of a heroic character  in real life frank ends up joining  forces with art after he finds out the  truth that art's daughter was captured  so that the pill could be synthesized  and tested on the new orleans populace  once it gets mass produced however the  problem will spread all across the world  if they can stabilize it then they'll  mass produce it  so whatever's happening here it's gonna  start happening everywhere  art turns himself into telios as a part  of a greater plan to save his daughter  there we meet head scientist gardner and  learn her justification for unleashing  dangerous drugs and performing  experiments on children she believes  she's a pioneer ushering in humanity to  its next  logical evolution she brings up the  example of henrietta lacks a woman whose  cancer cells were studied because  unlike normal people cells that died  when exposed to cancer  hers doubled the experiments done to her  helped scientists better understand how  viruses work  the effect of radiation on the body and  ultimately played a large role in the  development of the polio vaccine perhaps  it's a coincidence but both henrietta  and tracy are women of color  gardner believes the ends justify the  means that it's okay to do  a little bad for the greater good which  seems to be a recurring theme throughout  this film before art is saved by frank  he hints at his powers by comparing it  to that of a pistol shrimp a pistol  shrimp can fire bullets of bubbles at  its foes so strong and fast that the  sound is louder than an actual gunshot  this makes them pound for pound one of  the strongest animals on the planet  as we'll see in the film's climax art  can fire off tremendous bursts of energy  incinerating those around him he's the  pistol shrimp of new orleans but this  energy takes its toll  essentially killing him in the process  luckily his daughter has the ability to  heal this is hinted at earlier when we  see how a plant grows as she nears it as  well as biggie's presentation to the  investors where he talks about  how some animals have the ability to  heal themselves fun fact the name tracy  is derived from native irish meaning  fighter and superior  as the characters come out victorious  art says his story is done  he has his daughter and he can live his  life there's also a great shot of his  daughter taking off her medical bracelet  symbolic of her newfound freedom frank  however hints at the bigger conspiracy  that the government will likely not stop  here  they need to be exposed potentially  opening the doors for a sequel  and robin comes home and gives her  mother the much-needed money for her  surgery  oh and that can of soup which is a fun  nod to earlier in the film  robin's music is also heard on the radio  leading us to believe she's put her life  of selling drugs behind her  and has taken art's advice to follow  what she's good at but what superhero  power do you think you'd unlock if you  took the pill  me the ability to know if a movie is  good before i watch it that's all for  this video today please make sure to  like and subscribe and for more bad  takes you can follow me on twitter at  thinkstoryyt  until next time remember daddy loves you  very much


